flag provided but not defined: -x
Usage of particles:
particles moves particles in a box and shows each frame.
  -frames int
    	the number of frames to show (default 6)
  -height int
    	the rows of the box (default 8)
  -keys keys
    	the keys of each frame: p pauses, r resumes, q quits
  -live
    	pace the frames on the host's clock
  -loss int
    	the speed a particle loses at a wall
  -n int
    	the number of particles (default 12)
  -seed seed
    	the seed of the first particles (default 7)
  -width int
    	the columns of the box (default 24)
